            "review_title": "Review at The Pizza Company",
            "review_text": "Damien D\nIreland89 contributions\n0\nTerrible experience\nJun 2023 • Couples\nStopped here with my partner for pizza. Place was in chaos maybe due to it being international childrens day. Staff were completly overwhelmed. Sat and ordered food and drinks. 35 mins later no sign of food or drink while people who came in after were being served. Eventually a kind Vietnamese man who was sitting with his family came over and offered to help it was so obvious we were not getting served. He spoke to the staff and 10 mins later our drinks srrived. After a 1 hour wait our food arrived. It was awful. Clearly frozen pizzas thrown in to oven. Rest was bland froxen food. Staff were all youngsters late teens maybe and were clearly understaffed. They were ran off their feet. Whoever manages this place needs to take a long look in the mirror. Avoid at all costs.\nRead more\nWritten June 2, 2023",
